# challenges
challenge.badder_bosses.title=Badder Bosses
challenge.badder_bosses.description.short="Bosses are much tougher with this challenge!"
challenge.badder_bosses.description.detailed=§5Ender Dragon§r:\n+50% max health\n+15% extra pillars in the End\nExtra pillars and 25% of regular pillars have a second crystal embedded mid-pillar\n§8Wither§r:\n+35% max health\nSenses targets through walls\n15% of normal skulls become blue

challenge.hostile_champions.title=Hostile Champions
challenge.hostile_champions.description.short="You aren't the only who can level up."
challenge.hostile_champions.description.detailed=Hostile champions spawn across the whole world.\nOne in ten creatures acquire one of six special champion types:\n§6Blazing§r - +25% damage, attacks set victim on fire for 4 seconds, explodes in flames on death\n§5Projecting§r - +25% damage, +50% reach\n§aAntimagic§r - takes 35% less damage, can't be harmed if weapon involves magic\n§bGiant§r - twice the size, +25% reach, takes 50% less damage, drops extra loot\n§eBlessed§r - regenerates four times faster, can't be harmed without magic or silver aspects\n§cGrowing§r - grows stronger the longer it fights, starting with +20% damage and effective health up to +300%
