challenge.on_diet.title=On Diet
challenge.on_diet.description.short="Food's already scarce, but you have to watch your portions as well!"
challenge.on_diet.description.detailed=Nutrition is thirded.\nSatiation is halved, but never disappears.\nProteins and Phytonutrients are thirded.\nIf Nutrition leaves remainder after thirding, Satiation increases by 1.\nMinimal nutrition is 5 half-shanks instead of 6.\nEvery 5 levels minimal nutrition increases by half a shank.

challenge.faith_is_my_armor.title=Faith is My Armor
challenge.faith_is_my_armor.description.short="Take on the world with nothing but some leather to protect you."
challenge.faith_is_my_armor.description.detailed=All armor after leather is drastically worse, yet better armor still could be forged.\nProtection enchantment is half as efficient.\nResistance effect is half as efficient.\nSpecial protections are untouched.

challenge.pharmacophobia.title=Pharmacophobia
challenge.pharmacophobia.description.short="Imagine how awful it is to be allergic to every illness cure. No need to imagine though."
challenge.pharmacophobia.description.detailed=Potions and consumables which gave Regeneration and Instant Health effects would now give Poison and Instant Damage effects respectively.\nThis change affects only player.

challenge.barren_land.title=Barren Land
challenge.barren_land.description.short="There seems to be no healthy plants left in this accursed world..."
challenge.barren_land.description.detailed=The world looks sick.\nTree crowns are thin and small.\nLeaves drop fruits only when mined with effective tool.\nSaplings die.\n75% of flowers replaced by dead bushes.\nPumpkins barely spawn.\nCacti barely spawn.\nCrops grow only on fertilized farmland, and every growth consumes manure.\nGrass drops seed with 10% chance when mined by effective tool.

challenge.swarm_intelligence.title=Swarm Intelligence
challenge.swarm_intelligence.description.short="Watch your back, they are going to follow you."
challenge.swarm_intelligence.description.detailed=Monsters share location of their target to nearby monsters.

challenge.into_darkness.title=Into Darkness
challenge.into_darkness.description.short="You can barely see past your nose."
challenge.into_darkness.description.detailed=True darkness.\nNew moon's light is too dark to see anything\nHell is in darkness.\nIn darkness hostiles spawn 12 times closer to player instead of 3 times closer.\nBeing in darkness slows player down by 20%.

challenge.forbidden_runes.title=Forbidden Runes
challenge.forbidden_runes.description.short="What a great world of magic! Huh? You forgot to learn the language?!"
challenge.forbidden_runes.description.detailed=Enchantment language is incomprehensible, as well as Enchanting Table.\nAnvils could be used to work with magic.\nIt's still possible to carve runes on stones.

